# Phase 4: Knowledge Graph, Related Items & Semantic Search

The AI foundation laid out using Qdrant vector embeddings can now be aggressively leveraged for high-tier features: A D3.js Knowledge Graph, context-aware "Related Items" panels, and a core Semantic Search engine.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Backend: Vector Similarity APIs

#### [MODIFY] `src/utils/qdrant.js`
- **`recommendSimilar(itemId, userId)`**: Maps the native Qdrant `recommend()` method to instantly find geometrically similar vectors without recalculating embeddings.
- **`embedText(text)`**: Ensure the text-embedding module natively interfaces with Qdrant for semantic search queries.

#### [NEW] `src/controllers/graph.controller.js`
- **`GET /api/items/graph`**: Fetches all user vectors. Performs an *O(n²)* Cosine Similarity pairing (efficient at standard dashboard payload sizes). Yields a structural payload: `{ nodes: [], links: [] }` targeting pairs with similarities `> 0.65`.
- **`GET /api/items/:id/related`**: A highly focused proxy for `recommendSimilar`.
- **`POST /api/items/search`**: Takes a string query, sends it to `gemini-embedding-001`, and queries Qdrant for items closest to that meaning.

#### [MODIFY] `src/routes/items.routes.js`
- Attach the newly defined endpoints.

---

### 2. Frontend: D3.js Visualization & UI

#### [NEW Dependency] `react-force-graph-2d` & `d3-force`
- Integrates a hardware-accelerated Canvas wrapper around raw `d3.js` force engines—the industry standard for React-based graph visuals.

#### [NEW] `src/pages/Graph.jsx`
- Initializes a full-page Canvas drawing the semantic relationships.
- Nodes will portray user documents. Edges (links) will connect documents mathematically deemed "related".
- Contains interactive hover logic (highlighting linked neighbors).

#### [MODIFY] `src/pages/Cluster.jsx` (Related Items Panel)
- Inside your Document Modal, we will add a **"Related Items"** ribbon at the bottom.
- When an item is selected, it will rapidly hit `/api/items/:id/related` and display 3-5 mathematically similar items as clickable shortcut cards.

#### [NEW] `src/pages/Search.jsx` (Semantic Search)
- Fulfilling the "there should be a search feature" requirement: Provide a dynamic search page utilizing embeddings so you can search concepts (e.g. "how to build neural networks") and retrieve documents that are semantically a match, even if those exact words never appear.

